{\b My Private Server}\par
\par
Copyright (c) 2026 the owner of this software. All rights reserved.\par
\par
This software runs on your own computer. Your files, databases and websites stay on your own drives. It does not require any subscription, hosting or domain. Optional external services (for example a remote-access tunnel or GitHub) are used only when you turn them on, and the dashboard lists what each one receives.\par
\par
